 "campaign_json": "{\"type\": \"regular\", \"recipients\": {\"list_id\": \"d1ad6c7464\"}, \"settings\": {\"subject_line\": \"The first thing buyers ask me isn't about the kitchen\", \"preview_text\": \"Heating, drainage, broadband and the Home Report: what to have ready before you sell\", \"title\": \"Your Compass Guide, November 2026, Issue 6\", \"from_name\": \"Duncan Ure\", \"reply_to\": \"duncan@compass-estates.co.uk\"}}",
 "content_json": "{\"html\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\"><title>Your Compass Guide, Issue 6</title>\\n<style>\\n@media only screen and (max-width:600px){ .px{padding-left:24px !important;padding-right:24px !important;} .masthead{font-size:28px !important;} .h2{font-size:22px !important;} }\\n</style></head>\\n<body style=\\\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#363c52;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:0;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"660\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"max-width:660px;width:100%;\\\">\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;padding:40px 40px 32px 40px;\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://mcusercontent.com/227242e507c61fc419062b187/images/62effc1b-fed9-f8f0-b9e4-ec6b0ab3b09f.png\\\" alt=\\\"Compass Estates\\\" width=\\\"180\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:180px;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border:0;\\\"></a>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:28px;\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>\\n<h1 class=\\\"masthead\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;color:#f2f3f0;margin:28px 0 10px 0;text-align:center;line-height:1.2;\\\">Your Compass Guide</h1>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#f2f3f0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 14px 0;text-align:center;opacity:0.75;\\\">Property insight from Duncan Ure, Compass Estates</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#e0b940;margin:0 0 28px 0;text-align:center;letter-spacing:1px;\\\">Issue 6 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; November 2026</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"background-color:#f2f3f0;padding:0;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\">\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px 0 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;\\\">In this issue</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 28px 0;\\\">What buyers moving here ask me first</h2>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">When someone is moving to Dumfries &amp; Galloway from somewhere else, their first questions at a viewing are rarely about the kitchen. They are about how life here works. If you are thinking of selling, it helps to know what those questions are before anyone walks through your door.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">The first is usually heating and drainage. Away from the towns, plenty of homes run on oil rather than mains gas, and many drain to a septic tank. Buyers coming from a city have often never owned either. A clear answer on the age of the boiler, when the tank was last emptied and whether it is shared stops a nervous buyer from assuming the worst.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Next comes connection: broadband, mobile signal, and how far it is to a station, a supermarket and a GP. All of this is easy to check before you go to market, and I would rather put the answers in the property schedule than leave a buyer to guess.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Then the Home Report. Buyers from England expect to arrange their own survey, and many are surprised that the survey, Energy Report and Property Questionnaire are already done. That works in your favour. A buyer who has read the Home Report before viewing already knows the condition and the valuation, so there are fewer surprises later.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">None of this needs fixing before you sell. It needs answering. If you are thinking about a move next year, a valuation is a good time to go through these questions together, so the answers are ready before the first viewing.</p>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:16px 40px 48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 4px 0;line-height:1.3;\\\">Duncan Ure</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 28px 0;opacity:0.6;line-height:1.5;\\\">Director, Compass Estates<br>Dumfries &amp; Galloway</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://duncanure.co.uk/valuation\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Book a valuation</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px 24px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;\\\">Featured listing</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0;\\\">A converted stone byre at Carrick Shore</h2>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 40px 28px 40px;\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk/property/1789/3-bed-detached-house-for-sale-owl-cote-byre-carrick-shore-gatehouse-of-fleet/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://compassestates.10ninety.co.uk/PublicPropertyMedia/DisplayImage/18201?cropToFill=false&amp;useLargePhoto=true\\\" alt=\\\"The first floor lounge at Owl Cote Byre, with French windows onto the balcony\\\" width=\\\"580\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:580px;height:auto;border:0;\\\"></a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 40px 48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Owl Cote Byre turns the usual layout around. The living space is on the first floor, and French windows lead from the lounge out onto a balcony looking towards Fleet Bay, with the beach a few minutes away on foot.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">The kitchen shares that upper floor, with modern units and space for a table, while the lounge has a solid fuel stove and rooflights. Downstairs, both bedrooms have their own en-suite, and the principal bedroom has a door out to the garden. A box room upstairs works as a third bedroom or a study.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">It was built as a byre in the late 19th century and converted in 2003, keeping the stone walls and slate roof. Heating is oil fired, the windows are double glazed and the EPC is band C. Drainage is to a shared septic tank, and a parking space in the shared yard comes with it. Carrick Shore is reached along an unmade road and is quiet, with Kirkcudbright around nine miles away.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Offers over &pound;495,000.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">View the full listing and photos on <a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk/property/1789/3-bed-detached-house-for-sale-owl-cote-byre-carrick-shore-gatehouse-of-fleet/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color:#363c52;text-decoration:underline;\\\">compass-estates.co.uk</a>.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Thinking of selling something similar? Book a free valuation and find out what your property could achieve.</p>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;text-align:center;\\\">What to expect</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 24px 0;text-align:center;\\\">A valuation from Compass Estates isn't a pitch</h2>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#363c52;margin:0 auto 32px auto;text-align:center;max-width:480px;\\\">It takes about 45 minutes. I will look at the property, give you an honest view of what it would sell for in the current market, and explain exactly what the marketing would look like. No obligation to proceed. Most sellers find it useful whether they go ahead or not.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://duncanure.co.uk/valuation\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Book your valuation</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;text-align:center;\\\">Refer a friend</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 24px 0;text-align:center;\\\">Know someone thinking of selling?</h2>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#363c52;margin:0 auto 32px auto;text-align:center;max-width:480px;\\\">Introduce them to me. If they sell with me, I will pay you &pound;100 as a thank you when their sale settles.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://duncanure.co.uk/refer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">How the referral works</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px 28px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;\\\">From the blog</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0;\\\">Cash house buyers in Scotland: what they pay and when they make sense</h2>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 40px 48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">If a chain has collapsed, a probate has dragged on or a house needs more work than anyone wants to take on, a quick cash offer can look tempting.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;margin-bottom:28px;\\\">This week's post sets out who cash buyers are, how to judge what they offer, and when the open market is still the better route for your sale.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://duncanure.co.uk/blog/cash-house-buyers-scotland\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Read the full post</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;text-align:center;\\\">Our latest listings</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#363c52;margin:0 auto 32px auto;text-align:center;max-width:480px;\\\">Browse everything we have on the market right now in Dumfries &amp; Galloway and beyond.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk/sales/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Have a look</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-top:3px solid #e0b940;padding:40px 40px 36px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0 0 28px 0;text-align:center;\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61572942736770\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Facebook</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/duncanure_compassestates/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Instagram</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Website</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\\n<a href=\\\"mailto:duncan@compass-estates.co.uk\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Email</a></p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0 auto 12px auto;text-align:center;opacity:0.7;max-width:460px;\\\">You're getting this email because at some point you asked to hear from Compass Estates. Perhaps through our website, one of our listings, a free valuation, or one of our local posts.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0 auto 24px auto;text-align:center;opacity:0.7;max-width:460px;\\\">We'll only ever share useful property updates and news from right here in Dumfries &amp; Galloway and across Scotland. If that's still of interest, great. If not, you can unsubscribe anytime below.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0 0 28px 0;text-align:center;opacity:0.7;\\\">Thanks for staying connected,<br><strong>Duncan</strong></p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0;text-align:center;opacity:0.6;\\\">Copyright &copy; 2026 Compass Estates Group. All rights reserved.<br>Compass Estates, Castle Douglas, Dumfries &amp; Galloway<br>Compass Estates Group, Alba Innovation Centre, The Alba Campus,<br>Livingston, West Lothian EH54 7GA<br><br><a href=\\\"*|UNSUB|*\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Unsubscribe</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href=\\\"*|UPDATE_PROFILE|*\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Update preferences</a></p>\\n</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n</td></tr></table>\\n</body></html>\\n\"}",
